@startuml C3_Update_Operation_Plans_Process_View
title C3 – Operation Plan Update (System Sequence)
hide footbox

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "OemOperationPlansComponent" as Component
participant "OemApiService" as SpaService
participant "OemProxyController" as Controller
participant "OemClient" as Client
participant "OEM Planning API" as OemApi
participant "Warning Engine" as WarningEngine

Operator -> Component : Submit edit form
Component -> SpaService : validate & build payload
SpaService -> Controller : PATCH /api/oem/operation-plans/{id}
Controller -> Client : Forward payload
Client -> OemApi : PATCH /oem/operation-plans/{id}
OemApi -> WarningEngine : Evaluate conflicts (crane/staff overlaps)
WarningEngine --> OemApi : Warnings[]
OemApi --> Client : 200 OK { plan, warnings, logEntry }
Client --> Controller : Forward response
Controller --> SpaService : OperationPlanUpdateResponse
SpaService --> Component : update UI state
Component --> Operator : Show success + warnings + audit entry

@enduml
